# Local QA / audit scratch scripts — never meant to ship. Kept out of the
# tree so they can't be swept into a commit again or break `eslint .`
# (they use Node `console`, which the browser/edge lint config rejects).
# (audit-full.mjs was committed by accident in c0f15d2 and removed since.)
audit-full.mjs
audit-*.mjs
qa-*.cjs
qa-*.mjs
do_commit.sh
